@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:维护材料与批次</u>\n<u>状态控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:材料</u>" as Material
participant "<u>:材料批次</u>" as Batch
participant "<u>:批次变更</u>" as BatchChange
participant "<u>:批次存量</u>" as Stock
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-32办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-32办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Material : 确认目录维护(规格、基本单位、换算及追溯要\n求)
activate Material
Material --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Material
K -> Batch : 立即隔离批次(原因及范围)
activate Batch
Batch -> BatchChange : 保留可用性变更(原值、原因、经办时间)
activate BatchChange
BatchChange --> Batch : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate BatchChange
Batch --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Batch
K -> Stock : 提供受影响余额(批次各位置)
activate Stock
Stock --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Stock
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 审核恢复或继续停用
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-32办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Batch : 审核恢复或停用(负责人意见、效期及异常依据)
activate Batch
Batch -> BatchChange : 保留恢复依据(确认人及当前条件)
activate BatchChange
BatchChange --> Batch : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate BatchChange
Batch --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Batch
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
note over K,Stock
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
